flowchart LR
    A[CSV file] --> B[Parse CSV]
    B --> C[Validate headers, dates, numeric values]
    C --> D[Group visits by source and date]
    C --> E[Group page views by page]
    C --> F[If search fields exist: group query clicks and impressions]
    F --> G[Aggregate CTR and weighted position]
    D --> H[Sort and report]
    E --> H
    G --> H
    H --> I[Console summary and recommendations]